# text = And so I say , when I see you with anything on your mind , that I feel quite sorry you haven't got somebody better about you than a blundering young rough-and-tough boy like me , who has got the will to console you , Uncle , but hasn't got the way -- hasn't got the way Wally , my dear boy if the cosy little old lady had taken her place in this parlour five and forty years ago , I never could have been fonder of her than I am of you I know that , Uncle Sol Lord bless you , I know that .
