# text = I don't know , Sir what it is you people see in Joe to make you hold him in such great request , all of you ; but this I know , Sir , that if he wasn't pretty tough , and obstinate in his refusals , you'd kill him among you with your invitations and so forth , in double-quick time J . B ., Dombey is the man for you to choose as a friend Beg your pardon , Sir but I hope you're a doin ' pretty well , Sir I shall have the honour of stokin ' of you down , Sir Beg your pardon , Sir .--
