# text = I quite forgot Not , Miss , but what we talked about the family and visitors and but what I heard much said , although the nurse before Mrs Richards make unpleasant remarks when I was in company , and hint at little Pitchers , but that could only be attributed , poor thing to habits of intoxication , for which she was required to leave , and did At all events , Miss I remember very well that this same gentleman , Mr Carker , was almost , if not quite , as great a gentleman with your Papa then , as he is now .
