# text = I have a difficulty in alluding to it to you , whose attachment to her father is naturally watchful and jealous of every word that applies to him But , as one who is devoted to Mr Dombey in his different way , and whose life is passed in admiration of Mr Dombey's character , may I say , without offence to your tenderness as a wife , that Miss Florence has unhappily been neglected -- by her father .
