# text = In my execution of that trust ; in my deep concern , which you can so well understand , for everything relating to him , intensified , if you will ( for I fear I labour under your displeasure ), by the lower motive of desire to prove my diligence , and make myself the more acceptable ; I have long pursued these circumstances by myself and trustworthy instruments , and have innumerable and most minute proofs Pardon me , Madam if in my perplexity , I presume to take counsel with you , and to consult your pleasure .
