# text = But it may be so And -- pardon me -- do I misconceive you when I think you descry in this , a likely means of humbling Mrs Dombey's pride -- I use the word as expressive of a quality which , kept within due bounds , adorns and graces a lady so distinguished for her beauty and accomplishments -- and , not to say of punishing her , but of reducing her to the submission you so naturally and justly require I am not accustomed , Carker , as you know to give such close reasons for any course of conduct I think proper to adopt , but I will gainsay nothing of this .
