# text = Where will you go , Susan I've got a brother down in the country Miss -- a farmer in Essex said the heart-broken Nipper , ' that keeps ever so many co-o-ows and pigs and I shall go down there by the coach and sto-op with him , and don't mind me , for I've got money in the Savings Banks my dear , and needn't take another service just yet , which I couldn't , couldn't , couldn't do , my heart's own mistress Now , here's the cab , and here's the boxes , get along with you , do I beg your pardon , Ma'am , but Mr Dombey's orders are imperative
