# text = You add to all this , do you , the last crowning meanness of making her a witness of the depth to which I have fallen ; when you know that you have made me sacrifice to her peace , the only gentle feeling and interest of my life , when you know that for her sake , I would now if I could -- but I can not , my soul recoils from you too much -- submit myself wholly to your will , and be the meekest vassal that you have I understand , Madam the spirit of opposition that turned your affections in that channel , but they have been met , Mrs Dombey ; they have been met , and turned back
