# text = Someone would have written , surely , by his desire , if he could not ; and have said , " on such a day , there died in my house ," or " under my care ," or so forth , " Mr Solomon Gills of London , who left this last remembrance and this last request to you Well said , my lad ; wery well said I have been thinking of this , or , at least I have been thinking of one thing and another , all through a sleepless night , and I cannot believe , Captain Cuttle , but that my Uncle Sol ( Lord bless him !) is alive , and will return .
