# text = I don't so much wonder at his going away , because , leaving out of consideration that spice of the marvellous which was always in his character , and his great affection for me , before which every other consideration of his life became nothing , as no one ought to know so well as I who had the best of fathers in him leaving that out of consideration , I say , I have often read and heard of people who , having some near and dear relative , who was supposed to be shipwrecked at sea , have gone down to live on that part of the sea-shore where any tidings of the missing ship might be expected to arrive , though only an hour or two sooner than elsewhere , or have even gone upon her track to the place whither she was bound , as if their going would create intelligence .
