# text = The fact is , that feeling extremely interested in everything that relates to Miss Dombey -- not for any selfish reason , Lieutenant Walters , for I am well aware that the most able thing I could do for all parties would be to put an end to my existence , which can only be regarded as an inconvenience -- I have been in the habit of bestowing a trifle now and then upon a footman ; a most respectable young man , of the name of Towlinson , who has lived in the family some time ; and Towlinson informed me , yesterday evening , that this was the state of things .
