# text = It induces a man to reflect , this kind of fatal catastrophe that events do occur in quite a providential manner ; for if my Aunt had been living at the time , I think the effect upon a devilish lively woman like herself , would have been prostration , and that she would have fallen , in point of fact , a victim Now , Dombey I beg your pardon Allow me another word .
