# text = My friend Dombey will permit me to say , that if any circumstance could have added to the most infernal state of pain in which I find myself on this occasion , it would be the natural amazement of the world at my lovely and accomplished relative ( as I must still beg leave to call her ) being supposed to have so committed herself with a person -- man with white teeth , in point of fact -- of very inferior station to her husband .
