# text = But while I must , rather peremptorily , request my friend Dombey not to criminate my lovely and accomplished relative until her criminality is perfectly established , I beg to assure my friend Dombey that the family I represent , and which is now almost extinct ( devilish sad reflection for a man ), will interpose no obstacle in his way , and will be happy to assent to any honourable course of proceeding , with a view to the future , that he may point out .
