# text = But it's never too late for a Indi widdle to mend ; and I hope to mend , Miss , with your kind trial ; and wishing , Mother , my love to father , and brothers and sisters , and saying of it I am very glad indeed to hear it Will you take a little bread and butter , and a cup of tea , before we go , Robin Thankee , Miss Gentlemen , we will resume our studies on the twenty-fifth of next month Gentlemen , when our friend Cincinnatus retired to his farm , he did not present to the senate any Roman who he sought to nominate as his successor said Doctor Blimber , laying his hand on the shoulder of Mr Feeder , B.A ., adolescens imprimis gravis et doctus , gentlemen , whom I , a retiring Cincinnatus , wish to present to my little senate , as their future Dictator .
