# text = It may not be inappropriate to the occasion , or altogether uninteresting to observe that my wife is a most extraordinary woman , and would do this much better than myself -- allow my friend Feeder to be married -- especially to to Miss Blimber To Mrs Feeder , my love said Mr Toots , fixing his eyes on his wife , as if for inspiration in a high flight , ' may the torch of Hymen be the beacon of joy , and may the flowers we have this day strewed in their path , be the -- the banishers of -- of gloom Very good , Toots !
